  "answer": "I couldn't find a past ticket reporting this exact problem: an SVG preview whose background stays dark after Windows switches to light mode. PowerToys#39367 is related, since it covers SVG thumbnails rendering black or white. It is about File Explorer thumbnails being wrong at load time, not about a preview failing to follow a theme change, so it isn't a match. The Light Switch tickets (#42389, #44259) cover theme-switching bugs in other parts of the UI. As a workaround, reselect the file or reopen the preview pane after changing the theme so the SVG reloads. Please leave this ticket open as a new report, and include your Windows version and whether Light Switch is enabled."
 },
